# Model files are DVC's job, EXCEPT the one models/current.json points to --
# that one is committed directly so a git-only deploy (Streamlit Cloud) has
# a working model without needing a DVC remote. After retraining, update
# this line to match the new models/current.json (or just re-run: it's one
# `git add models/<new-file>.pkl` plus removing the old !allow line below).
models/*.pkl
!models/cnt_model_20260915205331.pkl
